            <title>[ZEPPELIN-1123] Block Routes if user is not login yet</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-1123</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;When auth is activated in Zeppelin, we are hiding some menus so that user can&apos;t go on it.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;However the routes are not blocked so we can still access the page&lt;/p&gt;</description>
